#: ../../source/database/configuration.rst:14
msgid "Config File"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/database/configuration.rst:16
msgid ""
"CodeIgniter has a config file that lets you store your database "
"connection values (username, password, database name, etc.). The config "
"file is located at **app/Config/Database.php**. You can also set database"
" connection values in the **.env** file. See below for more details."
msgstr ""

