#: ../../source/database/configuration.rst:29
msgid ""
"The name of the class property is the connection name, and can be used "
"while connecting to specify a group name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/database/configuration.rst:32
msgid ""
"The default location of the SQLite3 database is the **writable** folder. "
"If you want to change the location, you must set the full path to the new"
" folder (e.g., 'database' => WRITEPATH . 'db/database_name.db')."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/database/configuration.rst:36
msgid "DSN"
msgstr ""

