msgid ""
"Some database drivers (such as Postgre, OCI8) requires a full DSN (Data "
"Source Name) string to connect. But if you do not specify a DSN string "
"for a driver that requires it, CodeIgniter will try to build it with the "
"rest of the provided settings."
msgstr ""

